        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"jffdougan\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/48/1882_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jffdougan:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If it wasn't Arcanist Lupus for all the limericks, it should have been.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Naw. &nbsp;Limericks are great, but I was stretching to fit them to theme of 'dark poetry'. &nbsp;The winning poem was really good.</p>",
